{
    "name": "每日任务",
    "description": "每日任务(手账)v2 四步闭环(2026-10-12 用户构思): ①开手账→领取已完成任务+采集(claim_scroll 一趟完成, save=daily_tasks); ②判断未完成(if_collected 读行分组进度); ③完成剩余任务(本期=社区点赞: enable_like 开 且「献上点赞」行 a<b 才跑 community_like——点赞唯一价值=完成该任务, 2026-10-12 用户裁定自社交 4.3 迁入; 已完成/行缺失跳过); ④再开手账→领取新完成奖励+二次采集留档(save=daily_tasks_after)。全程只点「领取」与弹窗关闭词, 不点「前往/交付」; 神秘订单板块不展开。编排位置=倒数第二(idle 之前; 其它模块顺带完成部分任务以减小判断量, 用户裁定)。",
    "status": "v2_cycle",
    "steps": [
        { "_note": "===== ① 开手账: 领取已完成任务 + 采集(claim_scroll 一趟完成) =====" },
        { "type": "ensure_home" },
        { "type": "click_text", "text": ["手账"], "delay": 2.5 },
        { "type": "wait_scene", "scene": "手账界面", "timeout": 8 },
        { "type": "claim_scroll",
          "region_rel": [0.40, 0.03, 0.95, 0.74],
          "tab_region_rel": [0.0, 0.10, 0.25, 0.45],
          "tab_variants": ["每日任", "日任务", "任务"],
          "claim_keywords": ["领取"],
          "close_keywords": ["点击任意处关闭", "恭喜获得"],
          "row_pair": true, "label": "daily_tasks", "save": "daily_tasks",
          "scroll": { "swipe": [0.68, 0.60, 0.68, 0.35], "duration_ms": 700, "settle": 1.5, "max_rounds": 12 } },
        { "type": "click_template", "template": "handbook_close.png", "threshold": 0.95,
          "region_rel": [0.90, 0.0, 1.0, 0.12], "no_fallback": true },
        { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 2.0 },
        { "type": "ensure_home" },
        { "_note": "===== ②判断未完成 + ③完成剩余任务(社区点赞, 2026-10-12 自社交 4.3 迁入) =====" },
        { "type": "if_config",
          "key": "enable_like",
          "value": true,
          "then": [
              { "_note": "「为精美搭配献上点赞吧」a<b(未完成) -> 执行社区点赞闭环(内部含每期 20 次额度守卫; 行缺失=当日无此任务要求 -> else 跳过)" },
              { "type": "if_collected", "label": "daily_tasks", "keywords": ["献上点赞"], "cond": "a<b",
                "then": [ { "type": "community_like", "delay": 1.0 } ],
                "else": [] }
          ],
          "else": [] },
        { "type": "ensure_home" },
        { "_note": "===== ④ 再开手账: 领取新完成任务的奖励 + 二次采集留档 =====" },
        { "type": "click_text", "text": ["手账"], "delay": 2.5 },
        { "type": "wait_scene", "scene": "手账界面", "timeout": 8 },
        { "type": "claim_scroll",
          "region_rel": [0.40, 0.03, 0.95, 0.74],
          "tab_region_rel": [0.0, 0.10, 0.25, 0.45],
          "tab_variants": ["每日任", "日任务", "任务"],
          "claim_keywords": ["领取"],
          "close_keywords": ["点击任意处关闭", "恭喜获得"],
          "row_pair": true, "label": "daily_tasks_after", "save": "daily_tasks_after",
          "scroll": { "swipe": [0.68, 0.60, 0.68, 0.35], "duration_ms": 700, "settle": 1.5, "max_rounds": 12 } },
        { "type": "click_template", "template": "handbook_close.png", "threshold": 0.95,
          "region_rel": [0.90, 0.0, 1.0, 0.12], "no_fallback": true },
        { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 2.0 },
        { "type": "ensure_home" }
    ]
}
